title: "Correlation Clustering of Organoid Images: Code"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/JannikPresberger/Correlation_Clustering_of_Organoid_Images"
abstract: >-
  Code for the GCPR 2024 paper "Correlation Clustering of Organoid Images":
  twin neural networks (TNI, TNH) and a partial quadratic assignment problem
  (PQAP) formulation for estimating the dissimilarity of organoid images,
  followed by correlation clustering of the images.
keywords:
  - correlation clustering
  - organoids
  - microscopy images
  - twin neural networks
  - quadratic assignment problem
